@startuml
[*] --> InitialState

InitialState : User Profile Management

InitialState --> ViewProfile : View Profile
ViewProfile --> [*] : Return to Initial

InitialState --> UpdateProfile : Update Profile
UpdateProfile --> ValidateUpdate : Validate Update
ValidateUpdate --> [*] : Success
ValidateUpdate --> UpdateError : Invalid Input
UpdateError --> [*] : Error Handling

InitialState --> AddContact : Add Contact
AddContact --> ValidateContact : Validate Contact
ValidateContact --> [*] : Success
ValidateContact --> ContactError : Invalid Input
ContactError --> [*] : Error Handling

InitialState --> DeleteProfile : Delete Profile
DeleteProfile --> [*] : Profile Deleted

[*] --> [*] : Exit System
@enduml
